## Task

Predict the multiclass glass type in column type using RI, Na, Mg, Al, Si, K, Ca, Ba, and Fe; exclude rownames; use a stratified random split with seed 42; maximize macro-averaged F1 subject to the complete fitted model being at most 100000 bytes.

