# Predictive Modeler report

## Task

Train a multilabel classifier assigning six specified music-emotion labels to each track from the explicitly listed audio feature columns, using a reproducible random split with seed 42 and no official split column. Optimize micro-averaged F1 while requiring the complete fitted model to be no larger than 50000 bytes.

## Outcome

Status: succeeded. Stop reason: budget_exhausted.

## Agent rationale

All 3 permitted trials were trained and evaluated. The independent linear multilabel model is the best feasible candidate (mean 5-fold micro-F1 0.6336213541389553); the compact baseline is feasible but scores 0.0, while the shallow extra-trees candidate scores 0.5023866505805271 and fails the 50000-byte model-size constraint.

